on_index":9,"source_sha256":"958f155b2beda5d9069b93930b10b4494b75189dd7d80e5dbc092d084d68134c","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":5}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Calvin: Hi Dave! Nice to hear from you. Since last chat, some things have happened. I had a lil car accident last Friday, kinda upsetting but no one was hurt. I've been dealing with insurance and repairs - taking up a lot of time and energy. Look at this photo!\n[Image caption: a photo of a red car with a black rim parked on a sidewalk]\n[S9T1] (dia_id: D9:1)\n\nDave: Sorry to hear about the car accident, Calvin. I'm glad to hear that nobody was hurt. Dealing with insurance and repairs can definitely be time-consuming and draining. Have you encountered any issues in the insurance process so far?\n[S9T2] (dia_id: D9:2)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave, thanks for checking in! The insurance process was a hassle - it took forever and there was a ton of paperwork. But it's all sorted now, and I'm getting it fixed up. Can't wait to drive it again!\n[Image caption: a photo of a tow truck parked in a parking lot]\n[S9T3] (dia_id: D9:3)\n\nDave: How long did it take to get everything sorted out? I'm glad it's all taken care of now!\n[S9T4] (dia_id: D9:4)\n\nCalvin: It only took a week to sort everything out. I was worried about the cost, but it wasn't too bad. Look at this photo from the auto repair shop. \n[Image caption: a photography of a man working on a car in a garage]\n[S9T5] (dia_id: D9:5)","text_sha256":"98648ea68b2984231743a12b760ead0f58a6edf1944530e2fc7a618e4a969966","timestamp":"2023-06-21T15:15:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D6:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":19,"line_start":18,"source_locators":["[S6T3]"],"text_sha256":"95eba2fcfad39165ac4bbc7cf8774c1bd3587f85ca3f12ee0c4978e9148d345a"},{"dia_ids":["D6:4"],"kind":"r